  message: "CLOSED done — PR #149, dev 009dd31c3d (2026-08-01).\n\nThe filed 14 copies were 35 by sweep time (L1: filings decay; the count\ngrew 2.5x since filing). 34 spliced via AST-anchored per-file asserts\ninto an aliased import of analyze.base.node_own_text — one None-safe\nhome, every historical call site untouched. css.py deliberately kept:\nits (node, source) variant is the OTHER contract (source-slice for\nre-parsed sub-trees), matching the pre-existing analyze.base.node_text.\nRecurrence linter in test_node_own_text.py fails the build on any new\nprivate copy (member_names enforcement shape), with css exempt by\nsignature.\n\nEVIDENCE: 2235 tests green across both swept packages;\ncheck-package-coverage all-green in isolation; mypy ratchet delta +0\n(720); net diff -163/+115."  # 0123
